hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"33","Subḥāna Rabbiyal-`Aẓīm. [three times] Glory to my Lord the Exalted (three times in Arabic) Reference: Abu Dawud, Ibn Majah, An-Nasa'i, At-Tirmidhi, and Ahmad. See Al-Albani's Sahih At-Tirmidhi 1/83."
"34","Subḥānaka Allāhumma Rabbanā wa biḥamdika Allāhum-maghfir lī. Glory is to You , O Allah , our Lord , and praise is Yours . O Allah , forgive me. Reference: Al-Bukhari 1/99, Muslim 1/350."
